       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F116L030.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD International Services                                       00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Exchange of currency amounts.                                   00080055
      *                                                                 00090001
      *                                                                 00100001
      * An ordinary call may look like this:                            00110001
      *                                                                 00120001
      *    Initialize                          R116L030-Currency-Xchange00130001
      *    Set   R116L030-Version        To    True                     00140001
      *                                                                 00150001
      * One of these:                                                   00160001
      * 1) Move  &from currency          To    R116L030-In-From-Currency00170001
      * 2) Set   R116L030-In-From-Basic-Cur                             00180001
      *                                  To    True                     00190001
      *                                                                 00200001
      * One of these:                                                   00210001
      * 1) Move  &to currency            To    R116L030-In-To-Currency  00220001
      * 2) Set   R116L030-In-To-Basic-Cur                               00230001
      *                                  To    True                     00240001
      *    Move  &from amount            To    R116L030-In-From-Amount  00250001
      *                                                                 00260001
      * At least one of these:                                          00270001
      * 1) Move  &bank no.               To    R116L030-In-Fin-Inst-No  00280004
      * 2) Move  &rate                   To    R116L030-In-Rate         00290001
      *    Move  &denomination           To    R116L030-In-Denomination 00300001
      *                                                                 00310001
      * You may specify which rate is to be used.                       00320037
      * This is relevant even when input rate is given, as this is used 00330037
      * to check rate deviation.                                        00340037
      * Default is parameter rate.                                      00350038
      * 1) Set   R116L030-In-Use-Parameter-Rate                         00360037
      *                                  To    True                     00370037
      * 2) Set   R116L030-In-Use-Buy-Rate                               00380037
      *                                  To    True                     00390037
      * 3) Set   R116L030-In-Use-Sell-Rate                              00400037
      *                                  To    True                     00410037
      *                                                                 00420037
      *    Call  'F116L030'              Using R116L030-Currency-Xchange00430001
      *                                        R7919999-Error           00440001
      *    End-Call                                                     00450001
      *                                                                 00460001
      *    Evaluate True                                                00470001
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Abend                                  00480001
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00490001
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00500001
      *                                                                 00510001
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Feil                                   00520001
      *        ...currency not valid / rate not found...                00530001
      *                                                                 00540001
      *      When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     00550001
      *        Move  R116L030-To-Amount  To    &currency amount...      00560001
      *                                                                 00570001
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00580001
      *                                                                 00590001
      *################################################################*00600000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00610000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00620000
      *050802!LG ! C200: Stop exchange with equal cc and man.rate!la90! 00621056
      *050500!HLR! D300: Changed the formula for "when other":   !LG10! 00630052
      *      !   !   Old: Compute  W-Rate                        !    ! 00640052
      *      !   !            =    W-From-Denomination           !    ! 00650052
      *      !   !            *    W-To-Rate / W-From-Rate       !    ! 00660052
      *      !   !            *    W-From-Denomination           !    ! 00670052
      *      !   !   New: Compute  W-Rate                        !    ! 00680052
      *      !   !            =    W-From-Denomination           !    ! 00690052
      *      !   !            *    W-To-Rate / W-From-Rate       !    ! 00700052
      *110400!HLR! Checks that fin.inst.no is filled in.         !LG10! 00710052
      *      !   ! Checks that currencies are filled in.         !    ! 00720050
      *      !   ! We accept that fin.inst.no is not the fin.    !    ! 00730050
      *      !   ! inst., uses F7918040 to find the correct no.  !    ! 00740049
      *030200!LG ! Endret til bruk av to-den. i D300             !LG10! 00750049
      *130100!HLR! Deviation check of input parameter rate is    !LG10! 00760043
      *      !   ! moved till after the Euro Rate preperation.   !    ! 00770043
      *      !   ! This because the NOK rate is irrelevant for   !    ! 00780043
      *      !   ! Euro currencies.                              !    ! 00790043
      *031299!HLR! One may now specify which rate is to be used  !LG10! 00800043
      *      !   ! - parameter, buy or sell rate - if no input   !    ! 00810043
      *      !   ! rate is given.                                !    ! 00820043
      *230999!HLR! When local / basic currency is involved,      !LG10! 00830040
      *      !   ! we always use the standard rate for the       !    ! 00840040
      *      !   ! other currency, regardless of which way       !    ! 00850040
      *      !   ! the calculation goes.                         !    ! 00860040
      *020699!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00870014
      *################################################################*00880000
       Environment Division.                                            00890000
       Configuration Section.                                           00900000
       Special-Names.                                                   00910000
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00920000
