             10  W-From-Currency         Pic  X(03).                    01090001
             10  W-From-Rate             Pic S9(08)V9(06)        Comp-3.01100001
             10  W-From-Denomination     Pic S9(05)              Comp-3.01110001
             10  W-To-Currency           Pic  X(03).                    01120001
             10  W-To-Rate               Pic S9(08)V9(06)        Comp-3.01130001
             10  W-To-Denomination       Pic S9(05)              Comp-3.01140001
             10  W-To-Decimals           Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01150001
      *                                                                 01160000
