             10  W-Local-Currency        Pic  X(03).                    01180043
             10  W-Local-From-Rate       Pic S9(08)V9(06)        Comp-3.01190043
             10  W-Local-From-Denomination                              01200043
                                         Pic S9(05)              Comp-3.01210040
             10  W-Local-To-Rate         Pic S9(08)V9(06)        Comp-3.01220043
             10  W-Local-To-Denomination Pic S9(05)              Comp-3.01230043
