             10  Ind-From                Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01590012
             10  Ind-To                  Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01600012
      *                                                                 01610012
             10  WD-Min-Rate             Pic  ZZZZZZZ9,99999.           01620012
